<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>’Twas all according to God’s plan</l><l>To trap the Devil, Satan.</l><l>His sphere of moving narrowed now,</l><l>Man’s flesh his habitation;</l><l>Though brilliant was his plan</l><l>To enter into man,</l><l>This man became instead</l><l>The means to bruise his head,</l><l>And finish him forever.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>So Christ put on our human flesh—</l><l>An act of wisdom purely.</l><l>And on the cross did thus enmesh</l><l>His foe held so securely.</l><l>Though desperate Satan’s plight—</l><l>He fought with all his might;</l><l>But when the morning came</l><l>Christ was alive again,</l><l>And Satan crushed forever.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
